WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.650
A click starts the journey. It does not confirm an enquiry.

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:11.300
Name the metric accurately. A call click is a recorded interaction.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:16.950
Read improvements and declines together. Tawod: two equal 14-day periods.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:22.950
Connect measurement with follow-up. Then review enquiry quality.
